 Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Deceased\" title=\"Category:Deceased\">Deceased</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cause_of_death\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cause of Death</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Blood loss following an <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratype</a> attack</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Order of St. George</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"house\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">House</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mask\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mask</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mask\" title=\"Black Mask\">Black</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"position\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Position</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Monster hunter<br />Council member</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"totem\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Totem</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hootie\" title=\"Hootie\">Hootie</a> the Owl Plush</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> <small>(sister)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_6\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 6\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> Issue #6</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_0\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 0\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> Issue #0</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Aaron Slaughter</b> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mask\" title=\"Black Mask\">Black Mask</a> monster hunter of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a> under <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">the Order of St. George</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a>'s superior and adoptive brother. Inducted into the organization following his orphaning in a car accident, Aaron would become bound to the owl <a href=\"/wiki/Totem\" title=\"Totem\">totem</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Hootie\" title=\"Hootie\">Hootie</a> and trained under <a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Slaughter\" title=\"Jessica Slaughter\">Jessica Slaughter</a> as a Black Mask. While initially alone, he would later be joined by <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>, who became his adoptive sister. \n</p><p>A young Aaron would become romantically involved with <span class=\"new\" title=\"Jace Boucher (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSmFjZV9Cb3VjaGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Jace Boucher</span>, who had posed as a new transfer to the <a href=\"/wiki/White_Mask\" title=\"White Mask\">White Masks</a> and was made his roommate due to a lack of space. After Jace attempted a coup of the House of Slaughter, Aaron fought against him, losing his fingers which had to be surgically re-attached. His defeat of Jace's monsters, however, would earn him his teeth as a hunter. He continued to train until reaching the status of a full Black Mask, and would work as Erica's superior from a position inside the House, rather than out in the field.\n</p><p>Aaron would be tasked with killing Jace Boucher, but upon discovering his sanctuary for victims of monsters, he helped him fake his death by cutting off his hand and delivering it to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Old_Dragon\" title=\"The Old Dragon\">the Old Dragon</a>, leaving Hootie with him. Shortly after this, Aaron would be sent into the field after Erica broke the Order's rules by allowing a civilian to see monsters. While he attempted to kill <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a>, he was stopped by Erica and convinced to defend the town of <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a>. While buying Erica time to find the children the monsters were after, Aaron was killed by a pack of <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratype</a> adolescents.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_0\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 0\">Issue #0</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_6\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 6\">Issue #6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\">Issue #7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 8\">Issue #8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_10\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 10\">Issue #10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12\">Issue #12</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_13\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 13\">Issue #13</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_16\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 16\">Issue #16</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_17\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 17\">Issue #17</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_19\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 19\">Issue #19</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_20\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 20\">Issue #20</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"Enter the House of Slaughter\">Enter the House of Slaughter</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"Enter the House of Slaughter\">Issue #1</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"House_of_Slaughter\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_(comic_series)\" title=\"House of Slaughter (comic series)\">House of Slaughter</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"House of Slaughter 1\">Issue #1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_2\" title=\"House of Slaughter 2\">Issue #2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_3\" title=\"House of Slaughter 3\">Issue #3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_4\" title=\"House of Slaughter 4\">Issue #4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_5\" title=\"House of Slaughter 5\">Issue #5</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>See: <a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter/Gallery\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter/Gallery\">Aaron Slaughter/Gallery</a></i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n</div></small></div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:42:48+00:00"}